<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-27T00:38:52.461Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:38:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan has halted trade at the Zangali and Torkham Iran crossings, creating a backlog of 2,271 trucks, while limited trade has resumed under partial operations. Pakistan accuses the Taliban of using Afghan territory to launch attacks against it and rejects Taliban claims that Pakistani strikes have caused civilian casualties. The Taliban government has reshuffled civilian and military officials in Badakhshan, and Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan have met with Iran amid renewed Houthi strikes and Mecca pact talks to prevent a wider war. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261026-iran-talks-mecca-pact-nations-war&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/7f6943d3-b089-49a7-a0bc-a6f677c09802?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/from-the-mecca-defence-pact-to-tehran-talks-is-the-middle-easts-security-landscape-shiftin&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFB5cmFRdHYxUjlhTDlIZ1laSTk1a21DUzVlcTBLQUpTY0NuY01XOU5DS21QUENDaGRWalBsb0Zha1diNUd3UDBfVA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9fWUtmcXRwaUl5TWFVSWhpa1NEQkF4N2MyTi1DUlNQU2FDeE5QUEJiODFTR2h2VGYwcTk1S1RYdGpJdVd0V0MtOGFTeGtndmF4T25JczNWTlYxaEVqRHk4UFFPaUxHaF9FVGpZSjloZzd0ck1yYWNFLV85aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Diplomacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VOA - Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iran Focus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href